{"id":"gamefreak-staff-107","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【工作日志】年初贺年点阵大赛临近截止","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"提醒贺年点阵大赛即将截止，并分享公司年初摆放的梅花盆景，流露出迎接春天气息的喜悦。","date":"2009-01-13","publication":"晴れたり時々曇ったり · 迫る！ 年賀ドットコンテスト〆切","source":{"title":"晴れたり時々曇ったり · 迫る！ 年賀ドットコンテスト〆切","url":"http://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/staff/?p=107","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20130808162750/http://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/staff/?p=107","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","Game Freak 员工","GF介绍","日记","宝可梦","招聘","更新通知","未分类"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":360,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-staff/entry-107/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/107/kaniko090113-2385abd6.jpg","cover_kind":"own","size":[314,234],"archive_type":"gamefreak_legacy_blog","summary":"提醒贺年点阵大赛即将截止，并分享公司年初摆放的梅花盆景，流露出迎接春天气息的喜悦。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div data-gf-language-panel=\"zh-CN\">\n大家好，我是负责网站开发的カニ子（蟹子）。<br>\n\n转眼间一月都过半了……<br>\n\n[贺年点阵大赛](http://www.gamefreak.co.jp/information/news_090101.html)的截止日期也越来越近了！\n\n截止日期是1月15日（周四）。<br>\n\n金、银、铜奖的获奖者还会得到礼物，<br>\n\n所以我们仍然在等待更多挑战者前来参加。<br>\n\n结果将于2月2日（周一）公布。敬请期待！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-legacy-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/107/kaniko090113-2385abd6.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/107/kaniko090113-2385abd6.jpg\" alt=\"梅\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure><br>\n\n这是从年初起就摆放在公司里的梅花盆景。<br>\n\n让人感受到春天的气息，真令人开心。\n\n<br>\n</div>\n\n<div data-gf-language-panel=\"ja\" hidden>\nこんにちは、Web開発のカニ子です。<br>\n\n早いものでもう1月も中旬…<br>\n\n[年賀ドットコンテスト](http://www.gamefreak.co.jp/information/news_090101.html)の締め切りが近づいてまいりました！\n\n〆切は 1/15（木）となっております。<br>\n\n金銀銅の入賞者にはプレゼントも用意していますので、<br>\n\n更なる挑戦者もまだまだお待ちしております。<br>\n\n結果発表は2/2（月）です。オタノシミに！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-legacy-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/107/kaniko090113-2385abd6.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/107/kaniko090113-2385abd6.jpg\" alt=\"梅\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure><br>\n\nこれは年始から会社に飾られている梅の盆栽です。<br>\n\n春っぽさが感じられて嬉しくなります。\n\n<br>\n</div>","markdown_ja":null}}